WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.063
Imagine your class had a huge pot of gold that was supposed to be spent on helping the planet.

00:00:06.013 --> 00:00:12.618
But the people put in charge of the gold decided to give lots of it to their own friends and businesses instead!

00:00:12.618 --> 00:00:15.868
That's what happened with the Green Slush Fund.

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:20.526
They gave away millions to themselves instead of playing by the rules.
